---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonld={jsonld} navVariant="inner">
<section class="hero">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Who we protect</span>
<h1>For procurement teams: independent evidence behind every India PO</h1>
<p class="lead">Procurement's job is defensible decisions. Our reports are built as evidence: photographed, standards-referenced, severity-classified—the paper trail that makes an India sourcing decision easy to stand behind.</p>
<div class="hero-ctas"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/why-independent/">Why independent</a></div>
</div>
</section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/supplier-verification-india/"><h3>Documented diligence</h3><p>Verification and audit reports that satisfy internal risk and compliance sign-off.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/pre-shipment-inspection-india/"><h3>Payment-linked inspection</h3><p>Balance-against-passed-PSI clauses that make quality contractual.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/why-independent/"><h3>One accountable partner</h3><p>Fixed fees, named inspectors, SLA-bound reporting—no man-day arithmetic.</p></a></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap prose-wrap"><p class="prose rv">Tell us your product, supplier status and destination market — we'll recommend the right sequence of services and a fixed quote within 2 hours. Every engagement is buyer-paid under our Independence Charter: we take nothing from factories, ever.</p></div></section>
<AudienceLinks current="procurement" />
<section class="final">
<div class="wrap">

<h2>Your next India order. Protected.</h2>
<p>Confirmed within 2 hours. Report within 24 hours of inspection. Paid by buyers only — never by factories.</p>
<a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
